so when the two brothers had made their  arrangements they set out on their  travels in company with the N voice and  journeyed for a whole year going  northward and northeastward before they  reached the court of that Prince and on  their journey they saw many marvels of  diverse and sundry kinds but of these we  shall say nothing at present because  Massa mark who has likewise seen them  all will give you a full account of them  in the book that follows when the two  brothers got to the great card he  received them with great honor and  hospitality and showed much pleasure at  their visit  asking them a great number of questions  first he asked about the Emperor's how  they maintained their dignity and  administered justice in their dominions  and how they went forth to battle and so  on and then he asked the like questions  about the kings and princes and other  potent aides and then he inquired about  the Pope and the church and about all  that is done at Rome and all the customs  of the Latins  and the two brothers told him the truth  in all its particulars with order and  good sense like sensible men as they  were and this they were able to do as  they knew the Tartar language well when  that prince whose name was Kubla Khan  Lord of the Tartars all over the earth  and of all the kingdoms and provinces  and territories of that quarter of the  world had heard all that the brothers  had to tell him about the ways of the  Latins he was greatly pleased and he  took it into his head that he would send  them on an embassy to the Pope so he  urgently desired them to undertake this  mission along with one of his barons and  they replied that they would gladly  execute all his commands as those of  their sovereign Lord  then the Prince sent to sermon to his  presence one of his barons whose name  was conquered town and desired him to  get ready for it was proposed to send  him to the Pope along with the two  brothers the Baron replied that he would  execute the Lord's 